Package: arakno
Title: ARAchnid KNowledge Online
Version: 1.4.0
Date: 2026-10-23
Authors@R: c(person("Pedro", "Cardoso", email = "pmcardoso@ciencias.ulisboa.pt", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Allows the user to connect with the World Spider Catalogue (WSC; <https://wsc.nmbe.ch/>) and the World Spider Trait (WST; <https://arachnidatraits.sci.muni.cz/araneae/) databases. Also performs several basic functions such as checking names validity, retrieving coordinate data from the Global Biodiversity Information Facility (GBIF; <https://www.gbif.org/>), and mapping.
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
